ed"," reaction refreshes the locally stored mandate summary. The ",[712,988,989],{"href":207},"customer portal"," is an alternative for broader self-service billing.",[501,992,994],{"id":993},"read-local-state-carefully","Read local state carefully",[484,996,997,620,1000,624,1003,1006,1007,1010,1011,849],{},[488,998,999],{},"isValid()",[488,1001,1002],{},"isOnGracePeriod()",[488,1004,1005],{},"isEnded()"," delegate to your local model. They are only as current as your webhook handling. The optional ",[488,1008,1009],{},"DerivesSubscriptionState"," trait derives them from the end date, not payment status. Handle payment recovery and entitlement rules explicitly; see ",[712,1012,1013],{"href":214},"Event flow",[1015,1016,1017],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(